      "review_description": "I decided on Beacon Solar following very poor experience with two other suppliers. The first Metrosolar and then Mark Group. I will provide a write up on these two under their own listing.Beacon Solar were wonderful and easy to deal with. Well priced and quality equipment. The deposit was paid and they had received approval from my power provider for the proposed installation within the week, something Metrosolar took almost a month to achieve!Installation was promised within 4 weeks and it was!Only problem is that when the installer was fitting the panels and micro inverters he did not record the inverters serial numbers so I can not access the online monitoring system. I have with held $1000 until they rectify this problem.That one issue aside. I recommend anyone considering a solar installation to contact Beacon Solar.",
